  "body": "## Description\n\nAdds an opt-in control to promote the selected exercise variation and entered workout values to the defaults used for future workout logs.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New feature\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changes Made\n\n- Add a per-exercise \"This is the new default\" checkbox to detailed workout logging.\n- Persist weight, labelled weights, incline, reps, sets, cable setting, and selected variation through an authenticated endpoint.\n- Preserve historical workout records and keep UI-only state out of logged exercise data.\n- Prevent stale exercise requests from overwriting the currently selected day's exercise list.\n- Support legacy flat exercise definitions when promoting a default.\n\n## Testing\n\n- [x] Backend tests\n- [x] Frontend tests\n- [x] Frontend lint\n- [x] Frontend production build\n- [x] Semantic release, retired-auth, image-fingerprint, and OpenTofu guards\n- [x] Mobile-width interactive UI verification at 390px\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Code follows project style guidelines\n- [x] Self-reviewed the code\n- [x] No breaking changes\n\n## Deployment Notes\n\nNo migration required. Container build is gated by PR CI.",
  "changed_files": 4,
